@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #64748B
  ArrowColor #334155
}
title 图5 预约状态图

state "待确认\nPENDING" as PENDING
state "已确认\nCONFIRMED" as CONFIRMED
state "已完成\nCOMPLETED" as COMPLETED
state "已取消\nCANCELLED" as CANCELLED
state "已拒绝\nREJECTED" as REJECTED
state "已过期\nEXPIRED" as EXPIRED

[*] --> PENDING : 买家发起预约\n（商品仍在售）
PENDING --> CONFIRMED : 卖家确认\n（商品变为已预订）
PENDING --> REJECTED : 卖家拒绝\n或商品被其他预约确认
PENDING --> CANCELLED : 买家取消\n或商品修改/下架
PENDING --> EXPIRED : 24 小时未处理
CONFIRMED --> COMPLETED : 卖家完成线下交易
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : 买家/卖家取消\n（填写原因）
CONFIRMED --> EXPIRED : 7 天未完成\n（释放商品）
COMPLETED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]

note right of PENDING
  同一商品允许多条 PENDING；
  同一买家同一商品只能有一条
  PENDING 或 CONFIRMED。
end note

note bottom of CONFIRMED
  同一商品最多一条 CONFIRMED；
  确认与商品状态更新在同一事务中完成。
end note

note right of COMPLETED
  终态：不能再次取消或恢复。
end note

@enduml
